00:09:46.886 --> 00:09:49.088 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's five bucks a month
if you want to support me,

00:09:49.088 --> 00:09:50.790 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then you can
participate and whatever.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.092 align:start size:81% position:19%
We've had not even
any arguments.

00:09:53.092 --> 00:09:55.728
The fact that I'm so big
