00:09:55.728 --> 00:09:58.631 align:start size:84% position:16%
their own boundaries
and being pro-joy

00:09:58.631 --> 00:10:02.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
and not being so sneering,
I think self selects

00:10:02.501 --> 00:10:04.503 align:start size:84% position:16%
for a certain quality
type of person.

00:10:04.503 --> 00:10:06.238
- Yeah, do you find
it changes your mood

00:10:06.238 --> 00:10:07.540
