00:10:11.911 --> 00:10:14.113
It's like bathing in vomit.

00:10:14.113 --> 00:10:16.349 align:start size:84% position:16%
Then I open up my
Locals, and I'm like,

00:10:16.349 --> 00:10:18.751 align:start size:84% position:16%
oh, these are all good
interesting people

00:10:18.751 --> 00:10:21.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
sharing things about
themselves, how pleasant.

00:10:22.288 --> 00:10:24.657 align:start size:84% position:16%
- That is, for many,
for my community,

00:10:24.657 --> 00:10:26.859
the Locals is being used as
an alternative to Facebook,

00:10:26.859 --> 00:10:28.294
because when people
are posting things

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:29.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
about their personal
lives or someone at work,

00:10:29.762 --> 00:10:31.230
the don't have to
worry about that,

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:33.432
people from high school,
casting dispersions them

