or screen capping them, right?

00:10:35.167 --> 00:10:36.369
For me, Twitter, and you and I

00:10:36.369 --> 00:10:37.637 align:start size:84% position:16%
have different
Twitter experiences

00:10:37.637 --> 00:10:39.939 align:start size:88% position:13%
because I'm much more
