00:10:44.543 --> 00:10:46.078
if people bought me this
book I don't really want

00:10:46.078 --> 00:10:49.181 align:start size:97% position:3%
just to spite you, and
yesterday, I just made $100

00:10:49.181 --> 00:10:51.417
to buy this antique book.

00:10:51.417 --> 00:10:53.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think you and I have
