00:11:23.516 --> 00:11:25.985
a manifesto that's gonna
make people very excited

00:11:25.985 --> 00:11:28.120 align:start size:94% position:6%
and very hopeful about the
future of this country,

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.322
because we've beaten some
very bad people before,

00:11:30.322 --> 00:11:31.891
