how bad it used to be.

00:11:31.891 --> 00:11:34.460 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Are you surprised that
people don't realize

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.961
that we will get through this?

00:11:35.961 --> 00:11:38.064
I mean this is sort of where
we started a few minutes ago.

00:11:39.765 --> 00:11:41.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
A certain amount of
people just feel like, oh,

00:11:41.734 --> 00:11:43.569 align:start size:81% position:19%
