00:11:57.783 --> 00:12:00.319 align:start size:97% position:3%
because then you have to
get a scratch in the battle.

00:12:00.319 --> 00:12:02.488
This has very much been
a message coming out

00:12:02.488 --> 00:12:04.623 align:start size:84% position:16%
