that it's over,

00:12:04.623 --> 00:12:06.926
give it up, you guys can't win.

00:12:06.926 --> 00:12:10.429 align:start position:0%
We're raised to trust these
people, raised to believe them,

00:12:10.429 --> 00:12:12.698
and some of us will trust
them and believe them.

00:12:12.698 --> 00:12:14.400
Then it's like, oh, wait, no.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.902 align:start size:97% position:3%
They've been lying to me about
everything since I was kid.

00:12:16.902 --> 00:12:18.104
They're lying about this.

00:12:18.104 --> 00:12:19.371
They want me to give up.

00:12:19.371 --> 00:12:21.607
Here's the thing,
even if you lose,

00:12:21.607 --> 00:12:24.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
at least you can lose
with your head held high.

00:12:24.376 --> 00:12:27.513
To give up for the
sake of these people

00:12:27.513 --> 00:12:30.116 align:start size:97% position:3%
and say you can't beat these
college professor types,

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:32.118
that you see these little
clips of them all the time,

00:12:32.118 --> 00:12:33.352
to me is an absurdity.

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:36.522 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Everyone knows what
the red pill is, Malice.

00:12:36.522 --> 00:12:37.823
What's the white pill?

00:12:37.823 --> 00:12:40.893 align:start size:88% position:13%
- The white pill is
the possibility of hope

00:12:40.893 --> 00:12:42.294
that the good guys will win.

00:12:43.896 --> 00:12:45.364
- That's it, that's it.

00:12:45.364 --> 00:12:46.298
- That's it.

00:12:46.298 --> 00:12:47.333
- All right, pimp yourself out.

00:12:48.901 --> 00:12:50.603
Pimp out your Locals.

00:12:50.603 --> 00:12:55.040
